@startuml HighLevelArchitecture
skinparam linetype ortho
title PropBench - High Level Architecture

actor "User (browser / admin UI)" as User
actor "CLI / Management" as CLI

package "PropBench (Django)" {
  [WSGI / runserver] as Server
  package "Web UI & API" {
    [Admin UI] as AdminUI
    [Property Grid UI] as GridUI
    [Public Property Views/API] as PublicAPI
  }
  package "Apps" {
    [properties app] as Properties
    [dictionaries app] as Dicts
    [groups app] as Groups
    [audit app] as Audit
    [import service] as ImportSvc
  }
  component "django-reversion" as Reversion
  component "Templates & Static (JS / JSONEditor / Tabulator)" as Static
}

database "Postgres/SQLite DB" as DB

User --> AdminUI : browse / edit
User --> GridUI : interactive grid
AdminUI --> Server
GridUI --> Server
PublicAPI --> Server
CLI --> ImportSvc : run import command

Server --> Properties : calls views/forms/models
Server --> Dicts
Server --> Groups
Server --> Audit
Server --> Reversion

ImportSvc --> ImportSvc : parse CSV (uses mapping)
ImportSvc --> Properties : create/update properties
ImportSvc --> Reversion : create per-row revisions
ImportSvc --> Audit : create audit rows via signals

Properties --> DB
Dicts --> DB
Groups --> DB
Audit --> DB
Reversion --> DB

Static --> User
Static --> AdminUI
@enduml